<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Summon Devil</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Conjurer (guild level 50)
Mana: 40
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre><a cmd='#'>cast summon devil</a>
</pre>
<p>The ultimate in summoning: a portal of fire opens, and a greater devil (level 
90) emerges to serve you. It follows you, fights beside you when you are in a 
fight, and when your hit points drop below a third it tries to rescue you. 
Like all summoned servants, it stays only a short time, from half a minute to 
a minute and a half, and doesn't take orders.
</p><p>Beware: if the spell fails, the devil steps through free, glad to be here 
unbound, and attacks you. At level 90, that is a fight few can survive.
</p><p>You must be standing. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Summon Demon</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Summoning Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>